  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Elections Support Libya, 2012-14</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Valstod Libyen 2012-14</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tv&#xe5;-&#xe5;rigt st&#xf6;d till valprocessen i Libyen efter inb&#xf6;rdeskriget under  2011. Tre val under en tv&#xe5;-&#xe5;rs period planeras. UNDP genomf&#xf6;r         projektet med syftet att st&#xe4;rka nationella institutioner att h&#xe5;lla    demokratiska valprocesser, samt st&#xf6;d till genomf&#xf6;rande av det tre     valen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Two-year support to the electoral process in Libya after the Civil    War in 2011. Three elections during the two-year period are planned.  UNDP will implement the project with the aim of strengthening         national institutions to support national insitutions to run credible and inclusive elections. as well as support for the implementation of the three elections.</narrative>
  </description>
